{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團BLACKPINK成員Lisa近來連連驚喜現身香港，屢屢被BLINK（BLACKPINK粉絲專稱）街頭捕獲。身為泰籍成員的她十分虔誠，今年年初已被發現素顏打扮低調現身沙田車公廟，手持香燭誠心參拜，有網民猜測今次Lisa再度來港，或是特意到車公廟還神。近日Lisa又被拍到回泰國拜象神，非常神心。</p><figure><img alt=\"Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150471416202924032217509.jpeg/lcmtZo8LHmdbdJSKMU5SvljwztYDMRX6bkcGH25HBh8\"/><figcaption>Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK成員Lisa被拍到在車公廟拜神。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260125/1092148525489197056314872.jpeg/ogA_NZJMqdVyScwCfPkQ7WNpVofxQF7c5TMLuOUzC7g\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK成員Lisa被拍到在車公廟拜神。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>Lisa紅衣拜象神</p><p>日前有網民在社交平台分享Lisa拜曼谷匯狂象神的照片。相中Lisa穿上紅衣，戴上口罩雙手合十參拜。雖然Lisa行蹤低調，但由於名氣太大，無論到哪裏都被粉絲一眼認出。雖然未知Lisa是祈願還是還神，但由於不少人拜象神專門祈求事業順利及成功，故網民估計Lisa求的是事業方面的願望。</p><figure><img alt=\"網民指見到Lisa拜象神。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163136435381997568306587.png/xGmlO1X1xa5vIPX5Db1XPSf3_Qx0K259zyisD88orA8\"/><figcaption>網民指見到Lisa拜象神。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紅衣雙手合十極虔誠。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163136432970141696514739.png/V66Gc0jk-AoVdVaLEDjc8t1Oel3p2f5wQWcJFEFnCRQ\"/><figcaption>紅衣雙手合十極虔誠。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150471415749939200456039.jpeg/coszKo0kBLP0ojwpMfVuWnD5_H1sQOZ1IXAz5iFwM-Y\"/><figcaption>Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"風格多變。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148588344134209536032687.jpeg/sUkarzFnwnK4QGP0Q1OLOZ30ufLCQfnvnNTE0ZzUxNE\"/><figcaption>風格多變。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"lisa世界盃開幕式演出現場曝光照片。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150470442935390208594270.jpeg/fHLZmfKbZiE7cvpSmfyMoEEdrMMPRs7vCI9_xQiPf8U\"/><figcaption>lisa世界盃開幕式演出現場曝光照片。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150471413535215616023791.jpeg/dDcWLb3lDgTnLdOxEQi41bziBJKdW19vc2tm53NrZuc\"/><figcaption>Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150471410859118592143502.jpeg/gWGNmiT8o723e_EAVZ9gMuFHNb8tgKfNPwLXsj8C17I\"/><figcaption>Lisa（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa靚！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150471420347158528834650.jpeg/FrELTWPihf2h-0fX0LyY6ylkl2b09Yb7tHGXBbRxlwU\"/><figcaption>Lisa靚！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa靚！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150471418363121664386972.jpeg/Yi45SsmcQHieGtHzGn4GjyqV99PCCgVsnxxlTZ8cZU0\"/><figcaption>Lisa靚！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK近日迎來出道十週年紀念日。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163069410403946496395274.jpeg/-YRwBr3xgaLKa-CdwRdaK1bZv4d_qxjfKXS4jCl0uIw\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK近日迎來出道十週年紀念日。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Lisa坦言未能為十週年做準備。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163069509909614592509361.jpeg/L9l1BLlsVV1M9UPE0Wu3bO-MTjLA339gdeNj93XjY_c\"/><figcaption>Lisa坦言未能為十週年做準備。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BLACKPINK8月8日迎來出道10周年。（Instagram@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163116360557924352186954.png/2yvCukECVYg6i3ArqaOP8WRMCp_2wMRYfsw0JX7MNCU\"/><figcaption>BLACKPINK8月8日迎來出道10周年。（Instagram@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-09T12:16:53.178321+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":685,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}